{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-topbright-busy-board-dj-sold-via-amazon-2512-0166","content_id":"a2877406-a1d6-4bb8-b44a-9b667067ad05","description":"Product Safety Report for ToPBRIGHT Busy Board DJ presenting a risk of strangulation. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"0a802512-4dcc-41bd-bfab-d9bbacf8334a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-02-11T09:52:10+00:00","id":"0a802512-4dcc-41bd-bfab-d9bbacf8334a","title":"Link to product and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-02-11T09:52:10+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698c514ad7b51513fcd8a3a7/2512-0166-product-safety-report-busy-board-DJ.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: ToPBRIGHT Busy Board DJ sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of strangulation because it has an excessively long attached cord.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon). The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Baby/Infant Stimulation Toys (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>ToPBRIGHT</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>121308</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0FKH1PC85</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>012732507001, Jul-2025, FBA15KNJMP2PU000036</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A busy board styled like a DJ deck with multiple switches.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_0a802512-4dcc-41bd-bfab-d9bbacf8334a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698c514ad7b51513fcd8a3a7/2512-0166-product-safety-report-busy-board-DJ.pdf\">Link to product and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of strangulation because the attached cord creates a loop that is long enough to wrap around the infant’s neck. If a guardian has stepped away from the infant/ does not notice this and the cord becomes too tight around the infant’s neck, they are at risk of asphyxiating.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0166</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T10:15:49Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-23T10:15:49+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-r